.sandcastle/

# Scratch captures from a real, signed-in browser: they show the account
# switcher, the label tree and whatever is in the inbox at the time. Ten of them
# were committed in the initial commit and had to be purged from history. The
# screenshots that ship are `docs/miel-*.webp`, taken against the seeded demo
# stack (see .claude/skills/demo-screenshots) and safe to publish.
.tmp-screenshots/